  "goals": [
    "Explain organisation from organelles to systems.",
    "Identify eight named cell structures and connect each to its role.",
    "Compare typical plant and animal cells while recognising specialisation.",
    "Explain differentiation and evaluate stem-cell benefits and limitations for Paper 2B.",
    "Connect carbohydrates, proteins and lipids to their elements and smaller units.",
    "Design controlled food tests and explain enzyme activity, temperature and pH effects.",
    "Explain diffusion, osmosis and active transport, including concentration and water-potential gradients.",
    "Calculate surface area per volume and evaluate living and non-living transport investigations.",
    "Explain photosynthesis, leaf adaptations and mineral requirements, and evaluate the prescribed plant investigations.",
    "Explain the specified dietary components,alimentary canal,peristalsis,digestive enzymes,bile and villus adaptations.",
    "Evaluate Paper2B food calorimetry without claiming measured trials.",
    "Explain ATP,aerobic/anaerobic pathways and seed respiration investigations.",
    "Interpret Paper2B plant gas exchange and hydrogencarbonate-indicator comparisons.",
    "Explain thoracic structures, ventilation, alveolar exchange and smoking consequences.",
    "Compare breathing observations and evaluate exercise-rate methods.",
    "Explain the need for internal transport and distinguish phloem and xylem cargo/routes.",
    "Explain Paper2B root-hair osmosis, leaf water loss and environmental effects; evaluate a potometer with controlled comparisons and uptake-rate calculations.",
    "Explain blood components, immune responses and circulation including liver/kidney routes; Paper2B vaccination and clotting remain distinct.",
    "Explain plant/organ excretory products and Paper2B urinary/nephron routes, ultrafiltration, selective recovery and ADH feedback. Coordination and later topics and unfamiliar assessments remain unfinished."
  ],
